# Architecture

- One feature per folder: `lib/features/<name>/{presentation,domain,data}`.
- **Domain**: entities + `abstract interface class` repositories. Pure Dart only — no `flutter/`, no plugins.
- **Data**: `*RepositoryImpl`, native/plugin calls. Implements domain interfaces.
- **Presentation**: pages, widgets, cubits/blocs. Depends on domain + `core/`, not on other features' data/presentation.
- Wire implementations in `lib/app/di.dart` only (`get_it`). Cubits take interfaces via constructor injection.

```dart
// BAD — cubit depends on concrete impl or engine
class ReadinessCubit extends Cubit<ReadinessState> {
  ReadinessCubit() : super(const ReadinessLoading());
  Future<void> load() => RecliteEngine().getEngineInfo();
}

// GOOD — interface injected in di.dart
class ReadinessCubit extends Cubit<ReadinessState> {
  ReadinessCubit(this._engine) : super(const ReadinessLoading());
  final EngineRepository _engine;
}
```

- Imports: `package:reclite/...`, not relative `../../`.
- State: `flutter_bloc` + `get_it` only. No Riverpod.
- Skip use-case classes that only forward one repository call; call the repository from the cubit.